---
import ResourceLayout from '../../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro';
---

<ResourceLayout
  title="Hermes Shipping Provider User Guide | Fulcrum Agentics"
  description="User guide for merchants using the Hermes Shipping Provider for BigCommerce checkout rates."
>
  <section class="site-shell resource-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Hermes Shipping Provider</p>
    <h1>User Guide</h1>
    <p>
      Hermes returns checkout shipping quotes using case-pack package data and
      carrier rates.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell resource-body">
    <h2>What Hermes Does</h2>
    <p>
      Hermes is a BigCommerce shipping provider that turns checkout cart items
      into physical packages for rating. It is designed for products sold by the
      each where the warehouse ships full cases, cartons, or packs.
    </p>

    <h2>Case-Pack Rating</h2>
    <p>
      A product can be sold as individual units in checkout while Hermes rates
      the shipment using the physical shipping case. For example, a pillowcase
      option sold as 72 eaches can be rated as one physical case when the product
      data says the case pack is 72.
    </p>

    <h2>Checkout Behavior</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>BigCommerce controls the shopper cart and selected shipping address.</li>
      <li>Hermes receives the shipping quote request from BigCommerce.</li>
      <li>Hermes builds packages from product and variant shipping data.</li>
      <li>Hermes returns available carrier quotes to checkout.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Required Product Fields</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Case-pack quantity.</li>
      <li>Case weight.</li>
      <li>Case width, height, and depth.</li>
      <li>Variant SKU or option data that identifies the sellable item.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
    <p>
      If no shipping quote appears, confirm the shopper address has a valid
      country, state or province, city, and postal code. Then confirm the product
      variant has complete case-pack weight and dimension data.
    </p>

    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>
      For support, contact
      <a href="mailto:hello@fulcrumagentics.com">hello@fulcrumagentics.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</ResourceLayout>
